The numbers is a list of 1, 3, -1, -3, 5, 3, 6, 7.
The width is 3.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The limit is last minus width plus 1.
The medians is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every start from 0 to limit.
The window is an empty list of whole numbers.
Place item start of numbers into window.
Place item (start plus 1) of numbers into window.
Place item (start plus 2) of numbers into window.
Sort window.
The middle is width divided by 2.
Place item middle of window into medians.

For each value in medians, show value.
